OL,3,GNEWSAHeidi The Hit Girl, 8, dreaming of
OL,4,Adarts glory
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeidi "The Hit Girl" may throw darts
OL,7,Fbearing Luke Littler's name, but the
OL,8,Feight-year-old is dreaming of sporting
OL,9,Fglory in her own right.
OL,11,FShe also hopes to inspire more girls to
OL,12,Ftake to the oche and show that darts
OL,13,Fcan be for everyone.
OL,15,FHeidi is one of about 200 young players
OL,16,Fwho attend Boundary Park Darts Academy
OL,17,Fin Oldham, Greater Manchester, each
OL,18,Fweek. It is believed to be one of the
OL,19,Flargest youth darts clubs in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
