OL,3,GNEWSAHeidi The Hit Girl, 8, dreaming of
OL,4,Adarts glory
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's not a lot of girls out there
OL,7,Fthat play darts," she said. "But I
OL,8,Fthought I'd give it a shot to inspire
OL,9,Fsome others to start playing because
OL,10,Fit's really fun."
